WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:47.000 --> 01:51.800
[Episode 14]

3
02:01.000 --> 02:02.640
Would you like something to drink?

4
02:02.640 --> 02:04.239
Why did you want to see me?

5
02:04.239 --> 02:05.640
If it's just to catch up,

6
02:05.640 --> 02:07.680
I don't think it's necessary.

7
02:07.680 --> 02:08.919
If it's not urgent,

8
02:08.919 --> 02:10.199
I wouldn't have contacted you.

9
02:10.199 --> 02:11.900
So?

10
02:12.600 --> 02:15.040
After what happened to An An,

11
02:15.040 --> 02:16.880
I've had little contact with my family.

12
02:16.880 --> 02:19.779
There are some things that I only heard about recently.

13
02:20.839 --> 02:22.540
What things?

14
02:30.160 --> 02:32.080
After An An's incident,

15
02:32.080 --> 02:34.200
Mr. Ji cut ties with our family.

16
02:34.200 --> 02:36.679
He stopped all contact.

17
02:36.679 --> 02:39.200
After what your family did,

18
02:39.200 --> 02:42.620
cutting ties was already an act of mercy from Mr. Ji.

19
02:43.640 --> 02:46.459
My family is indeed a bunch of bastards.

20
02:47.239 --> 02:48.712
I know.

21
02:48.712 --> 02:51.453
Mr. Ji used some methods back then

22
02:52.200 --> 02:54.040
to retaliate against the Zhou family.

23
02:54.040 --> 02:56.679
He's been cornering the Zhou Group.

24
02:56.679 --> 03:00.399
Now, the Zhou Group is on the verge of bankruptcy.

25
03:00.399 --> 03:05.719
My mom and Zhou Chu have been hit hard by him.

26
03:05.719 --> 03:08.880
That does sound like something Mr. Ji would do.

27
03:08.880 --> 03:12.320
Besides, Zhou Chu was already a mess.

28
03:12.320 --> 03:16.920
Mr. Ji soon got dirt on him and sent him to prison.

29
03:16.920 --> 03:18.660
He deserved it.

30
03:19.679 --> 03:21.380
Yes.

31
03:22.519 --> 03:26.999
But I heard Zhou Chu is about to be released.

32
03:26.999 --> 03:30.279
And my mom has always been vengeful.

33
03:30.279 --> 03:32.679
She'll definitely strike back.

34
03:32.679 --> 03:35.739
You know how vicious her methods are.

35
03:38.040 --> 03:39.679
So, what are you getting at?

36
03:39.679 --> 03:42.160
Are you threatening me?

37
03:42.160 --> 03:43.880
No, no.

38
03:43.880 --> 03:46.160
I just want you to warn Mr. Ji.

39
03:46.160 --> 03:47.519
If he returns to the country,

40
03:47.519 --> 03:49.679
he must be extremely careful.

41
03:49.679 --> 03:52.200
I let An An down.

42
03:52.200 --> 03:54.419
I'm too ashamed to face him.

43
03:55.160 --> 03:58.440
But... But I'm afraid.

44
03:58.440 --> 04:00.080
After all, they've already vowed

45
04:00.080 --> 04:03.200
to fight Mr. Ji to the death.

46
04:03.200 --> 04:06.299
You know they're capable of anything.

47
04:07.880 --> 04:09.559
And they...

48
04:09.559 --> 04:12.019
They've already started making moves.

49
04:15.160 --> 04:18.059
If there's nothing else, I'll be going now.

50
04:19.800 --> 04:21.499
Shen Mo.

51
04:24.880 --> 04:26.580
I'm sorry.

52
04:43.120 --> 04:45.599
If what Zhou Yang said is true,

53
04:45.599 --> 04:46.919
knowing Mrs. Zhou's character,

54
04:46.919 --> 04:49.120
she'll definitely go after Mr. Ji.

55
04:49.120 --> 04:52.413
It might even affect Ji Ning.

56
04:52.413 --> 04:54.959
That phone call Mr. Ji received earlier...

57
04:54.959 --> 04:58.120
Could it be... about the Zhou family?

58
05:31.519 --> 05:32.760
Why are you here?

59
05:32.760 --> 05:34.279
I couldn't get through to you.

60
05:34.279 --> 05:36.640
So, I came here to find you.

61
05:36.640 --> 05:38.000
I was busy just now.

62
05:38.000 --> 05:39.599
What's the rush?

63
05:39.599 --> 05:40.919
Where's Xiao Ning?

64
05:40.919 --> 05:43.020
He's sleeping upstairs.

65
05:43.760 --> 05:45.939
Zhou Yang came to see me today.

66
05:47.400 --> 05:48.560
What did he want with you?

67
05:48.560 --> 05:50.700
He wanted me to warn you.

68
05:51.399 --> 05:54.200
To warn you how dangerous things are.

69
05:54.200 --> 05:56.159
Did you know Zhou Chu was released?

70
05:56.159 --> 05:58.819
Do you know what Mrs. Zhou is like?

71
05:59.800 --> 06:02.599
- I know. - Then why did you come back?

72
06:02.599 --> 06:04.880
Didn't you already shift your business focus abroad?

73
06:04.880 --> 06:07.412
What can they do?

74
06:07.412 --> 06:10.166
The Zhou Group has already collapsed.

75
06:10.166 --> 06:14.440
I know that they're trying to make a comeback with a major project.

76
06:14.440 --> 06:17.440
Of course I have to stop them.

77
06:17.440 --> 06:19.140
For your sake.

78
06:20.240 --> 06:22.179
And for An An's.

79
06:23.719 --> 06:25.819
Besides, you're here.

80
06:26.440 --> 06:28.780
I'm afraid they'll hurt you again.

81
06:33.480 --> 06:36.639
So, you wanted to handle this alone?

82
06:36.639 --> 06:38.339
Is that it?

83
06:41.960 --> 06:44.193
Some things need to be settled.

84
06:44.193 --> 06:47.040
The Zhous hurt the two people I love most.

85
06:47.040 --> 06:50.359
I can't just let it go.

86
06:50.359 --> 06:52.220
What do you plan to do?

87
06:54.159 --> 06:55.859
Don't worry.

88
06:56.919 --> 06:58.900
I'll handle it.

89
07:01.760 --> 07:04.800
So, you didn't tell me you were back

90
07:04.800 --> 07:06.160
because you didn't want to involve me?

91
07:06.160 --> 07:08.021
If you were to...

92
07:11.320 --> 07:13.719
What would I do?

93
07:13.719 --> 07:15.739
If I were to what?

94
07:17.000 --> 07:18.760
If I get hurt by the Zhous again?

95
07:18.760 --> 07:20.460
I'm not afraid.

96
07:22.120 --> 07:23.820
I am.

97
07:25.080 --> 07:26.859
I told you.

98
07:27.919 --> 07:29.939
I'll always be here.

99
07:30.560 --> 07:35.739
I'm afraid if they find out that you're with me,

100
07:37.320 --> 07:41.622
they'll hurt you because of me.

101
07:46.599 --> 07:50.219
Then we'll fight side by side.

102
07:51.798 --> 07:54.280
Dad.

103
07:54.280 --> 07:57.599
Mr. Shen, you're here!

104
07:57.599 --> 07:59.440
I'm sorry, Xiao Ning.

105
07:59.440 --> 08:01.320
Did I wake you up?

106
08:01.320 --> 08:02.399
It's okay.

107
08:02.399 --> 08:03.440
I missed you so much.

108
08:03.440 --> 08:05.760
Are you here to play with me?

109
08:05.760 --> 08:06.959
Ji Ning, be good.

110
08:06.959 --> 08:08.819
Go back to sleep.

111
08:09.479 --> 08:12.399
What are you doing?

112
08:12.399 --> 08:16.059
Can the three of us sleep together?

113
08:17.720 --> 08:19.419
Let's go.

114
08:23.003 --> 08:24.343
In a couple of days,

115
08:24.343 --> 08:26.732
I'm going to a dinner party.

116
08:26.732 --> 08:28.432
Oh?

117
08:29.479 --> 08:31.906
The Zhous will be there, too.

118
08:31.906 --> 08:34.180
I'm competing with them for a project.

119
08:34.180 --> 08:36.940
They're counting on it to turn things around.

120
08:37.800 --> 08:40.480
The Zhous are at the end of their rope.

121
08:40.480 --> 08:43.719
If I can seize this project,

122
08:43.719 --> 08:46.580
they'll never be a threat again.

123
08:48.200 --> 08:49.600
But...

124
08:50.926 --> 08:52.400
They're people who will do anything

125
08:52.400 --> 08:54.619
to get what they want.

126
08:57.680 --> 08:59.986
So what?

127
08:59.986 --> 09:01.846
For An An.

128
09:03.880 --> 09:05.560
And for you.

129
09:10.440 --> 09:13.139
I want to go to that restaurant tomorrow.

130
09:14.959 --> 09:16.659
Okay.

131
09:28.040 --> 09:29.400
It's just a meal.

132
09:29.400 --> 09:31.760
Is it necessary to dress up so much?

133
09:31.760 --> 09:33.941
That depends on who I'm going with.

134
09:36.359 --> 09:37.839
Aren't we taking Xiao Ning?

135
09:37.839 --> 09:40.820
Don't worry. Chen will be with him.

136
09:41.720 --> 09:42.839
Don't spoil Xiao Ning too much.

137
09:42.839 --> 09:44.560
He's just moved to a new environment.

138
09:44.560 --> 09:46.800
I'm afraid he won't adapt well.

139
09:46.800 --> 09:48.240
The time you spend on him...

140
09:48.240 --> 09:50.220
is a bit too much.

141
09:51.680 --> 09:52.680
What?

142
09:52.680 --> 09:55.499
Are you jealous of a child now?

143
09:59.920 --> 10:02.859
Xiao Ning is a lot like you.

144
10:04.873 --> 10:06.119
- Chen. - Yes?

145
10:06.119 --> 10:07.560
Please take good care of Xiao Ning.

146
10:07.560 --> 10:08.759
- Of course. - We're heading out.

147
10:08.759 --> 10:10.379
All right.

148
10:12.200 --> 10:13.899
Bye-bye.

149
10:20.652 --> 10:22.672
After all these years,

150
10:23.320 --> 10:26.300
it feels like nothing has changed.

151
10:28.079 --> 10:29.759
What about the taste?

152
10:29.759 --> 10:31.619
It tastes even better.

153
10:40.560 --> 10:43.080
You've had too much to drink, man.

154
10:45.839 --> 10:48.639
Aren't you Mr. Ji and Mr. Shen?

155
10:48.639 --> 10:50.080
What a coincidence.

156
10:50.080 --> 10:52.200
Let's share a table and eat together.

157
10:52.200 --> 10:53.899
Come here.

158
10:56.400 --> 10:57.759
We've already finished.

159
10:57.759 --> 10:59.300
We're about to leave.

160
11:00.080 --> 11:01.920
It's not easy to run into old friends.

161
11:01.920 --> 11:03.440
Let's catch up.

162
11:03.440 --> 11:05.320
How long has it been since we last met?

163
11:05.320 --> 11:07.440
Are we even friends?

164
11:07.440 --> 11:08.839
You're really heartless.

165
11:08.839 --> 11:14.485
Mr. Ji, all these years, I've never forgotten you.

166
11:14.485 --> 11:16.959
Mr. Shen probably doesn't know,

167
11:16.959 --> 11:18.480
but thanks to Mr. Ji,

168
11:18.480 --> 11:21.260
I've been doing great these past few years.

169
11:22.119 --> 11:23.560
I almost couldn't survive

170
11:23.560 --> 11:26.166
in the entertainment industry before.

171
11:26.166 --> 11:28.920
Luckily, I worked hard enough.

172
11:28.920 --> 11:31.533
I'm doing even better than before.

173
11:31.533 --> 11:34.553
Everyone knows what you used to do.

174
11:35.520 --> 11:37.133
So what?

175
11:37.133 --> 11:39.192
As if you're clean.

176
11:41.080 --> 11:42.539
Check, please.

177
11:43.960 --> 11:46.080
It's okay.

178
11:46.080 --> 11:47.779
I'll get it.

179
11:50.200 --> 11:51.479
Oh, my.

180
11:51.479 --> 11:54.019
Why is Mr. Shen paying the bill?

181
11:56.560 --> 11:58.440
Of course.

182
11:58.440 --> 12:00.739
He's supporting me now.

183
12:01.639 --> 12:03.739
But who's supporting you?

184
12:05.186 --> 12:07.165
And who are you supporting?

185
12:08.839 --> 12:10.320
I'm so envious.

186
12:10.320 --> 12:13.040
If I'd known, I wouldn't have given up so easily back then.

187
12:13.040 --> 12:15.000
If I had kept pursuing you,

188
12:15.000 --> 12:18.141
maybe I would be the one standing there right now.

189
12:19.040 --> 12:20.779
You never had a chance.

190
12:28.440 --> 12:30.959
Oh, Mr. Zhao, you got a new one again.

191
12:30.959 --> 12:32.560
He's a groom every single night.

192
12:32.560 --> 12:35.359
When I'm tired of him, I'll give him to you guys.

193
12:35.359 --> 12:37.440
No thanks. Not my type.

194
12:37.440 --> 12:39.599
You're not allowed to leave tonight.

195
12:39.599 --> 12:40.999
Come home with me.

196
12:40.999 --> 12:43.280
Do you hear me?

197
12:43.280 --> 12:44.440
Zhao.

198
12:44.440 --> 12:45.813
I...

199
12:45.813 --> 12:47.520
I don't care.

200
12:47.520 --> 12:49.220
You're coming with me.

201
12:51.359 --> 12:52.560
Take care of yourself, Mr. Zhao.

202
12:52.560 --> 12:53.599
Take care now.

203
12:53.599 --> 12:54.680
Slow down, Zhao.

204
12:54.680 --> 12:56.599
Zhao, you've had too much to drink.

205
12:56.599 --> 12:59.340
No, I'm perfectly fine.

206
13:00.879 --> 13:02.719
You're really drunk.

207
13:02.719 --> 13:04.820
No, I'm not.

208
13:08.560 --> 13:09.639
Mr. Ji.

209
13:09.639 --> 13:10.879
Did you miss me?

210
13:10.879 --> 13:12.999
I missed you, too.

211
13:12.999 --> 13:15.400
Hello, Mr. Ji.

212
13:15.400 --> 13:17.100
You can leave.

213
13:20.019 --> 13:22.159
You really did miss me.

214
13:25.240 --> 13:26.800
If I'm not mistaken,

215
13:26.800 --> 13:28.747
you sent me away on purpose back then

216
13:28.747 --> 13:30.839
just so you could set me up, right?

217
13:30.839 --> 13:33.040
What are you talking about, Mr. Ji?

218
13:33.040 --> 13:34.840
I don't know what you mean.

219
13:34.840 --> 13:37.240
Admit it or not, it doesn't matter.

220
13:37.240 --> 13:39.160
I can't be bothered to argue with you.

221
13:39.160 --> 13:41.220
Do you know this person?

222
13:42.499 --> 13:45.119
I do.

223
13:45.119 --> 13:47.640
What do you want, Mr. Ji?

224
13:47.640 --> 13:49.400
Introduce us.

225
13:49.400 --> 13:50.920
I have a project to discuss with him.

226
13:50.920 --> 13:52.920
And what's in it for me?

227
13:52.920 --> 13:55.119
Back then, you were head over heels

228
13:55.119 --> 13:57.200
for that hillbilly, Shen Mo.

229
13:57.200 --> 13:59.200
You wouldn't even give me a second look.

230
13:59.200 --> 14:00.320
Mr. Zhao.

231
14:00.320 --> 14:02.640
If I took the evidence of your affairs over the years...

232
14:02.640 --> 14:05.080
and tell your benefactor,

233
14:05.080 --> 14:06.719
what do you think will happen to you?

234
14:06.719 --> 14:09.680
Will you still be able to work in showbiz?

235
14:09.680 --> 14:13.560
As for me, I happen to know your benefactor.

236
14:13.560 --> 14:15.959
Think about it.

237
14:15.959 --> 14:19.920
If I could destroy you once, I can do it again.

238
14:19.920 --> 14:22.839
You... You have no proof.

239
14:22.839 --> 14:24.312
Who would believe you?

240
14:24.312 --> 14:25.320
Fine.

241
14:25.320 --> 14:27.280
Then take a guess.

242
14:27.280 --> 14:30.100
Do I have proof of your affairs or not?

243
14:32.160 --> 14:34.520
It's just an introduction, right?

244
14:34.520 --> 14:35.960
Yes.

245
14:35.960 --> 14:38.301
Then I'll leave it to you, Mr. Zhao.

246
14:45.479 --> 14:47.726
You're not coming home tonight?

247
14:47.726 --> 14:49.266
No.

248
14:49.266 --> 14:51.879
I have a business gala to attend.

249
14:51.879 --> 14:53.580
Business?

250
14:54.240 --> 14:57.000
Is it the gala where the Zhou family will be present?

251
14:57.720 --> 14:59.420
Yes.

252
15:01.400 --> 15:03.420
Do you have to go?

253
15:04.639 --> 15:07.400
Everyone knows I'm fighting the Zhous.

254
15:07.400 --> 15:10.920
If I don't attend just because they are there,

255
15:10.920 --> 15:13.300
won't I look like a coward?

256
15:17.959 --> 15:19.659
Are you scared?

257
15:21.920 --> 15:23.619
I'm not scared.

258
15:42.083 --> 15:43.240
All right.

259
15:43.240 --> 15:44.752
Wait for me at home.

260
15:44.752 --> 15:46.812
I'll be back soon.

261
15:47.680 --> 15:50.186
If I don't deal with the Zhous for good,

262
15:50.186 --> 15:53.480
how can I be with you in peace?

263
15:53.480 --> 15:56.040
I won't allow anyone to hurt you.

264
15:56.040 --> 15:58.379
Even if it's just a possibility.

265
16:00.479 --> 16:02.320
Once Mr. Ji makes up his mind,

266
16:02.320 --> 16:04.280
no one can talk him out of it.

267
16:04.280 --> 16:06.800
The Zhous are so ruthless.

268
16:06.800 --> 16:08.320
Fighting them...

269
16:08.320 --> 16:11.906
How could it be as easy as he says?

270
16:11.906 --> 16:13.607
Unless...

271
16:23.440 --> 16:25.260
Mr. Ji.

272
16:26.639 --> 16:27.999
Mr. Ji is back.

273
16:27.999 --> 16:30.119
Is Mr. Ji returning to develop his business in China?

274
16:30.119 --> 16:32.080
Mr. Ji actually dared to return.

275
16:32.080 --> 16:34.440
After the way he clashed with the Zhous...

276
16:34.440 --> 16:36.479
He is Ji Ming Xuan, after all.

277
16:36.479 --> 16:38.879
He's not afraid of the Zhou family.

278
16:38.879 --> 16:39.999
You know what?

279
16:39.999 --> 16:42.779
Two years ago, Ji Ming Xuan's sister...

280
16:43.440 --> 16:45.800
This is going to be a good show.

281
16:46.759 --> 16:50.359
Mr. Ji, why didn't you tell me you were coming?

282
16:50.359 --> 16:52.759
It's been so long.

283
16:52.759 --> 16:56.080
When was the last time we met?

284
16:56.080 --> 16:58.699
It was at the hospital four years ago.

285
16:59.719 --> 17:01.680
It really is a pity.

286
17:01.680 --> 17:04.480
- An An was such a beautiful girl. - Shut up.

287
17:06.919 --> 17:09.439
Why are you so angry?

288
17:09.439 --> 17:13.299
I've had so much to say to you these past four years.

289
17:14.439 --> 17:18.599
Thanks to you, I've had a very happy four years.

290
17:18.599 --> 17:21.672
I didn't expect you to be out so soon.

291
17:21.672 --> 17:23.892
The Zhou family must have worked hard.

292
17:24.839 --> 17:28.439
If you put it that way, I really should thank you.

293
17:28.439 --> 17:30.280
If it weren't for you,

294
17:30.280 --> 17:31.400
I wouldn't have known how to deal

295
17:31.400 --> 17:34.440
with my useless brother, Zhou Yang.

296
17:34.440 --> 17:35.479
Oh.

297
17:35.479 --> 17:38.480
Allow me to reintroduce myself.

298
17:38.480 --> 17:40.159
My name is Zhou Chu.

299
17:40.159 --> 17:44.460
I'm now the one in charge of Zhou's Group.

300
17:56.783 --> 17:59.739
I know how hard it was for you to get this,

301
18:00.399 --> 18:05.680
so you'd better hold on to it tightly.

302
18:05.680 --> 18:08.160
Keep your eyes open even when you sleep.

303
18:08.160 --> 18:11.200
Otherwise, when you lose everything,

304
18:11.200 --> 18:12.560
you'll go back to being

305
18:12.560 --> 18:15.220
that good-for-nothing bastard again.

306
18:30.760 --> 18:32.679
What's wrong, Mr. Zhou?

307
18:32.679 --> 18:33.960
Why such a fierce expression?

308
18:33.960 --> 18:35.480
You're scaring me.

309
18:35.480 --> 18:37.240
Get lost.

310
18:37.240 --> 18:40.280
Ji Ming Xuan came to see me two days ago.

311
18:40.280 --> 18:41.560
What did he want?

312
18:41.560 --> 18:43.199
Take a guess.

313
18:43.199 --> 18:45.220
Don't give me that crap.

314
18:47.560 --> 18:49.639
He asked me to introduce him to someone.

315
18:49.639 --> 18:50.919
And this person...

316
18:50.919 --> 18:52.439
is someone you know, too.

317
18:52.439 --> 18:55.299
It seems to be related to your family's project.

318
18:56.373 --> 18:58.679
Did you introduce him?

319
18:58.679 --> 18:59.919
Of course.

320
18:59.919 --> 19:01.119
Ji Ming Xuan is so handsome.

321
19:01.119 --> 19:02.720
How could I have the heart to refuse?

322
19:02.720 --> 19:04.320
You!

323
19:04.320 --> 19:05.960
You ungrateful traitor!

324
19:05.960 --> 19:07.399
Hey!

325
19:07.399 --> 19:09.439
I'm reminding you out of respect for our friendship.

326
19:09.439 --> 19:11.119
What's with your attitude?

327
19:11.119 --> 19:13.460
I didn't have to tell you anything.

328
19:14.559 --> 19:16.760
Ji Ming Xuan...

329
19:16.760 --> 19:19.141
You've gone too far!

330
19:30.839 --> 19:32.679
Ming Xuan.

331
19:32.679 --> 19:34.399
Zhou Chu has had too much to drink.

332
19:34.399 --> 19:36.080
He's just talking nonsense.

333
19:36.080 --> 19:37.980
Please bear with him.

334
19:38.960 --> 19:41.019
You must be joking, Mrs. Zhou.

335
19:42.159 --> 19:46.720
You know, I don't really like that kid either.

336
19:46.720 --> 19:50.199
But unfortunately, the Zhou family has no one else.

337
19:50.199 --> 19:52.819
That was Zhou Yang's own choice.

338
19:54.760 --> 19:56.280
Ming Xuan.

339
19:56.280 --> 19:59.599
I'm practically someone who watched you grow up.

340
19:59.599 --> 20:03.199
Do you really have to be so ruthless?

341
20:03.199 --> 20:05.240
Regarding what happened to An An,

342
20:05.240 --> 20:07.800
I can understand how you feel.

343
20:07.800 --> 20:11.159
But our family's project...

344
20:11.159 --> 20:13.940
You just had to interfere.

345
20:16.520 --> 20:18.380
What is the meaning of this?

346
20:24.839 --> 20:27.159
Some things can be moved past,

347
20:27.159 --> 20:30.000
but some things never will be.

348
20:30.000 --> 20:35.405
Mrs. Zhou, don't think no one knows what you've done.

349
20:42.080 --> 20:44.320
How did you get here?

350
20:44.320 --> 20:47.220
Because we're fighting side by side now.

351
20:48.560 --> 20:51.680
I downloaded an app for our phones.

352
20:51.680 --> 20:53.679
What app?

353
20:53.679 --> 20:55.399
A location tracking app.

354
20:55.399 --> 20:57.919
This way, I can see you wherever you are.

355
20:57.919 --> 21:00.919
And of course, you can see me, too.

356
21:00.919 --> 21:02.240
What?

357
21:02.240 --> 21:04.299
Are you that afraid I'll run away?

358
21:07.720 --> 21:10.220
I'm afraid you won't be able to find me.

359
21:12.440 --> 21:13.795
Stop it. Come with me.

360
21:13.795 --> 21:17.639
Ming Xuan, I'm not finished yet.

361
21:17.639 --> 21:19.700
Are you leaving already?

362
21:21.120 --> 21:22.819
It's fine.

363
21:24.879 --> 21:26.839
Hello, Mrs. Zhou.

364
21:26.839 --> 21:28.700
Long time no see.

365
21:29.520 --> 21:31.220
And you are?

366
21:33.280 --> 21:35.560
This is my partner.

367
21:35.560 --> 21:37.260
Shen Mo.

368
21:39.000 --> 21:41.599
Mrs. Zhou, don't you remember me?

369
21:41.599 --> 21:45.779
I, for one, have a deep impression of you.

370
21:47.000 --> 21:49.359
Is there anything else you'd like to discuss with us?

371
21:49.359 --> 21:51.220
If not...

372
21:53.520 --> 21:55.620
we'll take our leave.

373
22:05.040 --> 22:07.080
The Zhou family...

374
22:07.080 --> 22:08.640
must never be destroyed

375
22:08.640 --> 22:11.060
at the hands of Ji Ming Xuan.

376
22:13.240 --> 22:16.940
In that case, destroy him.

377
22:17.600 --> 22:20.160
Do you know how dangerous that was just now?

378
22:20.893 --> 22:22.353
Yes.

379
22:24.280 --> 22:27.480
Letting the Zhous know we've reconciled,

380
22:27.480 --> 22:30.100
letting them know you're my weakness...

381
22:31.439 --> 22:33.439
So what?

382
22:33.439 --> 22:36.080
They'll find out sooner or later.

383
22:36.080 --> 22:38.859
You did that on purpose, didn't you?

384
22:38.859 --> 22:41.719
Parading yourself in front of them

385
22:42.399 --> 22:45.080
and even provoking Mrs. Zhou.

386
22:45.080 --> 22:47.980
Since you've already guessed it,

387
22:49.119 --> 22:51.739
why did you play along with me?

388
22:54.879 --> 22:57.499
She truly used to be my nightmare.

389
22:58.240 --> 23:01.180
Even just a brief encounter with her

390
23:02.560 --> 23:07.739
still makes me recall the time I spent in that room.

391
23:10.360 --> 23:12.740
But I'm not afraid anymore.

392
23:14.520 --> 23:17.599
As long as you're by my side,

393
23:17.599 --> 23:19.940
I'm not afraid of anything.

394
23:23.280 --> 23:25.499
If it weren't for you,

395
23:26.119 --> 23:28.359
I would have been dead long ago.

396
23:28.359 --> 23:31.080
What else is there to fear?

397
23:31.080 --> 23:32.120
I just wanted to see.

398
23:32.120 --> 23:35.260
Mrs. Zhou's panicked face.

399
23:36.000 --> 23:40.359
With her suspicious and ruthless nature,

400
23:40.359 --> 23:41.839
she'll definitely think I'm back

401
23:41.839 --> 23:43.440
to seek revenge on her.

402
23:43.440 --> 23:45.979
She'll think I have something on her.

403
23:47.040 --> 23:50.199
Don't they want to fight you, Mr. Ji?

404
23:50.199 --> 23:52.900
Then let's drive them to desperation first.

405
23:57.000 --> 23:59.520
I was wrong before.

406
23:59.520 --> 24:01.779
It's not that you haven't changed at all.

407
24:02.399 --> 24:04.339
You've changed a lot.

408
24:05.000 --> 24:07.660
I've learned

409
24:08.920 --> 24:10.820
a great deal from you, Mr. Ji.

410
24:13.560 --> 24:17.900
Mr. Ji, I won't allow anyone to hurt you.

411
24:19.600 --> 24:21.520
Okay. I understand.

412
24:21.520 --> 24:23.679
I'll be right there.

413
24:23.679 --> 24:25.440
What happened?

414
24:25.440 --> 24:27.520
Oh, it's nothing.

415
24:27.520 --> 24:29.980
Just a small matter at work.

416
24:31.160 --> 24:33.879
I might be back a bit late.

417
24:33.879 --> 24:35.779
I'll wait for you.

418
24:36.520 --> 24:39.439
In the meantime, don't leave the villa.

419
24:39.439 --> 24:40.792
Just in case.

420
24:40.792 --> 24:42.839
Okay.

421
24:42.839 --> 24:44.239
Good.

422
24:47.880 --> 24:49.439
- Mr. Shen. - Yes?

423
24:49.439 --> 24:51.240
Why is Dad so busy lately?

424
24:51.240 --> 24:53.980
He has no time to play with me.

425
24:54.760 --> 24:55.760
Don't worry.

426
24:55.760 --> 24:57.320
He won't be busy for much longer.

427
24:57.320 --> 24:59.240
The three of us can play together then, okay?

428
24:59.240 --> 25:00.819
Okay.

429
25:03.520 --> 25:06.860
My orange juice is ready.

430
25:11.056 --> 25:12.520
Hello?

431
25:12.520 --> 25:14.193
Boss, where have you been?

432
25:14.193 --> 25:16.152
I feel like I haven't seen you in ages.

433
25:16.152 --> 25:17.639
I'll be at the studio in a couple of days.

434
25:17.639 --> 25:19.000
Hold the fort for now.

435
25:19.000 --> 25:20.160
Geez.

436
25:20.160 --> 25:23.120
You were diligent for two days, and now you're slacking off again?

437
25:23.120 --> 25:24.199
What's the world coming to?

438
25:24.199 --> 25:27.953
I'm the boss, yet I'm being lectured by my employee.

439
25:27.953 --> 25:30.572
By the way, are you free right now?

440
25:30.572 --> 25:33.440
There's a fire inspection later, but I forgot.

441
25:33.440 --> 25:35.800
I have a date to see a show with my boyfriend.

442
25:35.800 --> 25:37.320
It was so hard to get these tickets.

443
25:37.320 --> 25:39.640
Can you come and handle the inspection?

444
25:39.640 --> 25:41.280
Right now?

445
25:41.280 --> 25:42.320
Yes.

446
25:42.320 --> 25:44.879
Please? Pretty please?

447
25:44.879 --> 25:46.560
Fine. Go ahead.

448
25:46.560 --> 25:47.919
I'll drive over now.

449
25:47.919 --> 25:50.240
You're the best boss in the world!

450
25:50.240 --> 25:51.640
Yep.

451
25:53.655 --> 25:54.680
- Chen. - Yes?

452
25:54.680 --> 25:56.200
I'm going out for a bit. I'll be right back.

453
25:56.200 --> 25:57.239
Take good care of Ji Ning.

454
25:57.239 --> 25:58.760
Make sure he doesn't eat too many sweets.

455
25:58.760 --> 26:00.080
Understood. I'll remember.

456
26:00.080 --> 26:01.400
Goodbye, Mr. Shen.

457
26:01.400 --> 26:03.100
Bye-bye.

458
26:25.919 --> 26:28.080
Chen, what's wrong?

459
26:28.080 --> 26:29.520
Mr. Shen went out this evening.

460
26:29.520 --> 26:32.560
He said he'd be back soon, but he hasn't come back yet.

461
26:32.560 --> 26:34.919
Ji Ning is crying and asking for him.

462
26:34.919 --> 26:37.760
I just called Mr. Shen, but I couldn't get through.

463
26:37.760 --> 26:40.420
Can you try to reach him?

464
26:43.640 --> 26:45.380
Please let him be okay.

465
26:46.240 --> 26:47.940
Please let him be okay.

466
27:02.200 --> 27:04.919
Is this place safe?

467
27:04.919 --> 27:08.119
Don't worry. There are no cameras for miles around here.

468
27:08.119 --> 27:10.040
No one ever comes to this place.

469
27:10.040 --> 27:12.000
It's absolutely foolproof.

470
27:12.000 --> 27:15.320
Zhou Chu, I have to admit,

471
27:15.320 --> 27:18.040
even though you're a bastard,

472
27:18.040 --> 27:21.802
you're more like a Zhou than my own son.

473
27:21.802 --> 27:24.182
I still have a lot to learn from you.

474
27:30.280 --> 27:33.706
Where did all that arrogance go?

475
27:33.706 --> 27:34.960
I really want to see

476
27:34.960 --> 27:36.960
exactly what kind of charm you have

477
27:36.960 --> 27:41.939
to make Zhou Yang and Ji Ming Xuan fall head over heels for you.

478
27:46.359 --> 27:50.240
Despicable tactics are all you're capable of.

479
27:50.240 --> 27:52.700
I might not be able to handle Ji Ming Xuan,

480
27:53.400 --> 27:55.699
but I can certainly handle you.

481
27:56.320 --> 27:58.120
Still acting tough even when facing death.

482
27:58.120 --> 28:00.300
Let him cool off a bit.

483
28:17.893 --> 28:19.832
Are you ready to behave now?

484
28:22.760 --> 28:25.059
You're asking for it!

485
28:26.919 --> 28:29.220
What are you waiting for? After him!

486
28:33.320 --> 28:34.800
Stop!

487
28:34.800 --> 28:36.301
Don't run!

488
28:37.339 --> 28:38.839
Stop!

489
28:50.720 --> 28:52.699
You're quite the runner.

490
28:59.120 --> 29:00.680
That's enough.

491
29:00.680 --> 29:02.240
Don't kill him.

492
29:02.240 --> 29:04.600
It's time to get down to business.

493
29:04.600 --> 29:09.860
Now, let's see how much you're worth to Ji Ming Xuan.

494
29:10.600 --> 29:13.541
Call Ji Ming Xuan using his phone.

495
29:19.639 --> 29:21.040
Mr. Ji.

496
29:21.040 --> 29:23.080
I've ordered everyone to look for Mr. Shen.

497
29:23.080 --> 29:25.380
The police have also begun their search.
